  ("On which record can Jasse be heard?", "On a single record verified by opening its primary page: “Not A Word”, by Khallion, featuring Jasse and Gwada G, billed bouyon 2026 in the very heading of the YouTube page. It is the only recording entered in the structured data of this profile."),
